disco elysium the final cut is set for  release on march 30th  and it significantly expands the game  zoom released in october 2019  along with releasing on playstation 4  ps5 and stadia  with plans for switch and xbox versions  in the future the final cut adds new  quests  new characters and myriad small changes  throughout the game  that will allow players to solve  problems in new ways here's all the big  changes coming to the final cut  for more coverage like this video and  subscribe to our channel  the biggest difference between the  original disco elysium and the final cut  is a huge amount of new voice acting the  man  lands with a dull thump like a broken  down puppet of muscles  and sinew for a moment he still tries to  keep his head up  based eyes looking at you with  unimaginable surprise  the new version is fully voiced which  was a huge undertaking  according to voice over director jim  ascholivi disco elysium contains about a  million words that had to be voiced  which is about as many words as in all  the harry potter novels combined  whining about your back every time you  bring out the measuring tape  honey you're a man with a fork in the  world of soup  please let's just try to enjoy the game  all right it features performances by 59  actors from around the world  in order to capture the feeling that  disco setting  rabbishole is a melting pot of different  cultures and accents  the amount of new voice acting is what  you'll notice most in the final cut but  it's far from the only change  the new version includes four additional  quests that can be unlocked based on  your political  alignment depending on your choices in  interacting with other characters  and what you choose from disco elysium's  thought cabinet  you can wind up on one of four political  vision quests that add new characters  story and development to your  protagonist the four quests aren't all  the same length  but each will have a potential impact on  the later portion of disco elysium's  story  lead artist kaspar thomsolu says the  quest should offer players culmination  and catharsis  giving them a chance to explore their  characters different possible political  leanings  and learn more about the game's world  there are a lot of other  smaller improvements in disco elysium  the final cut as well  the game's frame rate has been improved  new art and music has been  added and there are new ways to solve  problems scattered throughout the game  so if you've played disco elysium before  you might want to check it out again  there are also new additions to make  streaming the game easier and more  interesting  the final cut includes a streaming mode  that will replace copyrighted music  throughout the game  and there are new twitch integrations  that will let players vote on streamers  actions as they play  thomsolu said you'll even be able to  vote to either increase or decrease a  streamer's stats while you watch  which could change how key moments in  the game play out  with the addition of political vision  quests and full voice acting  the developers say the final cut is  disco-elysium as they always  intended it to be and it should be a lot  easier to play on your couch when you  don't have to read a million words to  enjoy it  as you slam your fist on the button the  man collapses  entirely his head rolling to the side  looks like you're the new measure head  now  her voice is surprisingly calm no one is  the new measure head  let's go before he gets up if you want  to know more about disco elysium  we have an in-depth interview with  robert kirbitz its writer and lead  designer  about the feature that almost sank the  entire project  thanks for watching  [Music]  you
 

